621					<h3>Live Region Example</h3>
622					<p>Click the button to announce a message using a live region. This demonstrates how screen readers are notified of dynamic updates.</p>
623					<button id="announce" type="button">Announce message</button>
624					<div class="live-region" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
625						<span id="live-message"></span>
626					</div>
627				</article>
