645				<h2 id="accessibility">Accessibility Features</h2>
646				<article class="card">
647					<h3>Data Table Example</h3>
648					<p>Accessible tables have proper headers, captions, and semantic structure for screen readers.</p>
649					<table>
650						<caption>Browser compatibility for modern features</caption>
